Package: XLintR
Title: Assess the Structural Complexity of Statistical Tables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("NISRA", "TechLab", email = "techlab@nisra.gov.uk",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Detects table-like structures in Excel workbooks and assesses
    their structural complexity. Provides diagnostic measures and
    recommendations intended to help authors produce tables that are
    easier for users to interpret.
